<title>UK: UK Q2 c/a surplus 792 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Q2 c/a surplus 792 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics issued the following revised seasonally adjusted current account data for the second quarter -</p>
<p>    TRADE (in million stg)     Q2	 Q2(PREL)  Q1	 Q2,95</p>
<p>    Current account	    792	 (457)  -1,276   -1,410</p>
<p>    Trade in goods	  -3,212    (-3,601)  -3,669   -3,333</p>
<p>    Trade in services	1,739     (1,858)   1,305    1,677</p>
<p>    Investment income	3,597     (3,654)   2,415    1,886</p>
<p>    Transfers		 -1,332    (-1,454)  -1,327   -1,640</p>
</text>
